## EmberEchoCopy

ember_echo_copy-RestaurantName = Ember & Echo
ember_echo_copy-Kicker = Five Ovens contender · Dioxus
ember_echo_copy-Title = The crust crackleth. The courtyard answereth.
ember_echo_copy-Manifesto = Smoke curlest through olive leaves; stone holdeth the day’s last warmth; every blistered edge returneth the ember’s call.
ember_echo_copy-SignatureName = The Blue-Hour Ember
ember_echo_copy-SignatureDescription = Embered aubergine, preserved lemon, olive leaf, and sheep’s milk cheese upon a smoke-kissed crust.
ember_echo_copy-RivalryClaim = Hear the four distant ovens call; our fire answereth last, and the cup listeneth.
ember_echo_copy-SelectLabel = Choose the courtyard tongue
ember_echo_copy-ImageAlt = A blistered pizza meeteth the flame inside Ember & Echo’s wood-fired oven at dusk.
ember_echo_copy-DoughTitle = Dough · the hush
ember_echo_copy-DoughBody = Long-fermented dough resteth cool as courtyard stone, gathering air before the evening song.
ember_echo_copy-FireTitle = Fire · the call
ember_echo_copy-FireBody = Olive wood flareth; the vaulted oven casteth its copper voice across each turning crust.
ember_echo_copy-FinishTitle = Finish · the echo
ember_echo_copy-FinishBody = Lemon, leaf, and warm cheese answer the smoke, brightening the final bite like lanterns at blue hour.

## CourtyardLocaleStatus

courtyard_locale_status = The courtyard answereth in { $locale }.

## CourtyardWelcome

courtyard_welcome = Call softly, { $guest }; the ember knoweth thee.

